			"description": "<div class='info-title'><span class='info-icon blue'>🏢</span> Company Name</div><div class='info-box highlight'>Enter the <span class='bold'>official registered name</span> of your company.</div><ul class='info-list'><li>Name as per MCA/ROC registration</li><li>Include Pvt Ltd, LLP suffix if applicable</li><li>Must match GST and PAN records</li></ul><div class='info-box warning'><span class='bold'>Important:</span> Loans are available for Indian companies only.</div>",
