			"key": "companyType",
			"question": "Company Type",
			"description": "<div class='info-title'><span class='info-icon gold'>🏢</span> Company Structure</div><div class='info-box highlight'>Select your <span class='bold'>company's legal structure</span>.</div><div class='visual-diagram'><div class='diagram-row'><span class='diagram-label'>OPC</span><span class='diagram-value'>Single owner company</span></div><div class='diagram-row'><span class='diagram-label'>Private Ltd</span><span class='diagram-value'>2+ shareholders</span></div><div class='diagram-row'><span class='diagram-label'>Partnership</span><span class='diagram-value'>2+ partners</span></div><div class='diagram-row'><span class='diagram-label'>LLP</span><span class='diagram-value'>Limited liability partnership</span></div></div><div class='info-box note'><span class='bold'>Note:</span> Documentation requirements vary based on company type.</div>",
